-- Core/API.wowlua
-- The public API: the global SuuUI. Built-in modules and plugin addons use
-- only what is published here (documented in Docs/API.md). Anything a module
-- needs from the core is added here, never reached for in another module's
-- internals. Built-in modules import it (`import SuuUI from "/Core/API"`);
-- plugins read the global.

